meta {
  name: List Sales
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sales?page=1&pageSize=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  List bills, newest first. Defaults to today's bills.

  Returns:
  - items: bill summaries (id, invoiceNumber, createdUtc, totalAmount, primaryPaymentMethod, lineCount)
  - page, pageSize, hasMore (no total count: the list is for finding a bill, not a report)

  Query params (all optional):
  - from, to: yyyy-MM-dd. Default: today. A malformed date returns 400.
  - page: Page number (default: 1)
  - pageSize: Items per page (default: 50, max: 200)

  Roles: Cashier sees today's bills only (another day returns 403).
  StoreManager and SystemAdmin (reports.view) can query any day.
}
